{"id": "EUVD-2026-95883", "enisaUuid": "de37f22a-f3f3-395b-bf6b-da9016bd2b57", "description": "MOVO through 0.2.3 contains an authorization bypass vulnerability in the chat-api document endpoints that allows authenticated users to access other users' stored objects by supplying arbitrary object paths. Attackers who know a target's object path can send it to /api/documents/fetch or /api/documents/save-blueprint to read private documents and overwrite presentation blueprints.", "datePublished": "2026-10-09T15:04:57", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T01:55:25", "baseScore": 7.6, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haind/cve-2026-108110-movo-document-authz", "https://github.com/himovo/movo/blob/v0.2.3/services/chat-api/app/api/endpoints/documents.py#L237-L274", "https://github.com/himovo/movo/blob/v0.2.3/services/chat-api/app/api/endpoints/documents.py#L91-L109", "https://github.com/himovo/movo", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/movo-through-0.2.3-authorization-bypass-via-document-endpoints"], "aliases": ["GHSA-33xm-96fg-7hfc", "CVE-2026-108110"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.24, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "80f24811-449c-3787-8ff0-0a333c6a9f33", "product": {"name": "MOVO", "vendor": {"name": "himovo"}}, "product_version": "0.1.0 \u22640.2.3"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "e0494fcd-9cd4-39d5-90f2-3ec6f05fec0b", "vendor": {"name": "himovo"}}], "isExploited": false}